<title>USA: Worldwide reports 10 months results.</title>
<headline>Worldwide reports 10 months results.</headline>
<dateline>ARDSLEY, N.Y. 1996-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Worldwide Equipment Corp said its unaudited year-to-date pre-tax income for the first 10 months of fiscal 1997 ended June 30 was $998,804 from sales of $13,534,143.</p>
<p>The company said for the total prior year, the fiscal 12 months ended August 31, 1996, its pre-tax earnings were $694,687 from sales of $23,339,124.</p>
<p>Worldwide Equipment is an international trading company engaged in purchasing and selling new and used heavy-duty construction and earthmoving equipment on a world-wide basis as well as manufacturing the Romanian ARO 4X4 sports utility vehicle.</p>
</text>
